@startuml gambar-arsitektur-recommendationservice
title Arsitektur RecommendationService - 3 Lapisan (Bab II Subbab 2.9.9)
skinparam backgroundColor White
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho

package "Lapisan Antarmuka (Client)" {
  [Prototipe Aplikasi Flutter] as flutter
}

package "Backend Laravel" {
  [REST API] as api

  package "Lapisan Logika" {
    [ContentBasedFilter] as cb
    [CollaborativeFilter\n(berbasis memori)] as cf
    [SwitchingWeightedCombiner\n(switching hybrid + weighted)] as combiner
  }

  package "Lapisan Data" {
    database "Profil Pengguna" as dataProfil
    database "Atribut Kos" as dataKos
    database "Data Interaksi" as dataInteraksi
  }
}

flutter --> api

api --> cb
api --> cf
cb --> combiner : Skor_CB
cf --> combiner : Skor_CF
combiner --> api : Skor_hybrid + Top-N

dataProfil --> cb
dataKos --> cb
dataInteraksi --> cf

note bottom of flutter
  Lapisan antarmuka HANYA menampilkan hasil
  rekomendasi dari REST API -- tidak melakukan
  perhitungan apa pun (thin client), sesuai
  Subbab 2.9.1 & 2.9.9.
end note

note right of combiner
  Menerapkan strategi switching hybrid
  berkomponen weighted (Subbab 2.2.3):
  Skor_hybrid = alpha x Skor_CB + (1-alpha) x Skor_CF
  Cold-start: alpha = 1 otomatis (Skor_CF tidak dihitung).
end note

note bottom of dataInteraksi
  Data interaksi antarpengguna TIDAK PERNAH
  dikirim ke perangkat klien -- seluruh
  perhitungan CollaborativeFilter tetap di
  server, menjaga konsistensi antara model yang
  dievaluasi dan model produksi (Subbab 2.9.2).
end note

@enduml
